# Windows Subsystem for Linux (WSL) Specific Configuration
# This file contains aliases and settings specific to WSL environments
# Provides integration with Windows host system

# Windows Integration Aliases
alias explorer='/mnt/c/Windows/explorer.exe'  # Open Windows Explorer from WSL
alias zeal="${WINHOME}/scoop/shims/zeal.exe"  # Launch Zeal documentation browser (Windows version)

# Note: Additional WSL-specific configurations can be added here
# Common WSL integrations include:
# - Accessing Windows executables
# - Mounting Windows drives
# - Clipboard integration
# - Windows browser launching
